        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(discord): add HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY env fallback for gateway WebSocket",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nDiscord Gateway WebSocket connections did not honor `HTTP_PROXY`/`HTTPS_PROXY` environment variables, forcing deployments with egress restrictions (Kubernetes/OpenShift with network policies) to allow broad `:443` egress, which is a security downgrade.\n\nWithout this fix, Discord channel deployment required either:\n1. Broad `:443` egress from gateway pods (violates security policies), or\n2. Explicit `channels.discord.proxy` configuration (blocked by loopback-only validation)\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis brings Discord Gateway WebSocket behavior in line with:\n- ✅ Discord REST API (`extensions/discord/src/monitor/rest-fetch.ts:35`)\n- ✅ WhatsApp WebSocket (`extensions/whatsapp/src/session.ts:193`)\n\nBoth already support environment proxy fallback. This change completes the proxy support story for Discord.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Enables**: Secure Discord channel deployment in restricted network environments (enterprise, air-gapped, NERC OpenShift, etc.)\n\n**Before**: Required broad `:443` egress workaround\n```yaml\n# Network policy - insecure\negress:\n  - to:\n    - ipBlock:\n        cidr: 0.0.0.0/0\n    ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 443\n```\n\n**After**: Uses operator-managed proxy with fine-grained egress control\n```yaml\n# OpenClaw config\nenv:\n  - name: HTTPS_PROXY\n    value: \"http://openclaw-proxy:8080\"\n\n# Network policy - secure\negress:\n  - to:\n    - podSelector:\n        matchLabels:\n          app: openclaw-proxy\n    ports:\n    - protocol: TCP\n      port: 8080\n```\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Code Changes\n- Added `createEnvProxyDiscordGatewayAgent()` helper mirroring `rest-fetch.ts:35` pattern\n- Modified `createDiscordGatewayPlugin()` to try env proxy before direct connection\n- Explicit `channels.discord.proxy` still overrides env proxy (backward compatible)\n- Added required imports: `formatErrorMessage`, `resolveEnvHttpProxyAgentOptions`\n\n### Testing\n- ✅ All 162 Discord extension test files pass (1812 tests)\n- ✅ TypeScript compilation successful\n- ✅ Follows existing proxy patterns (REST API, WhatsApp)\n- ✅ Backward compatible (direct connection if no proxy env vars)\n\n### Validation\n```bash\npnpm test extensions/discord\n# Test Files  162 passed (162)\n# Tests  1812 passed (1812)\n```\n\n## Related\n- Fixes #98266\n- Related to #60035 (broader proxy configuration support)\n- Reported by: OpenClaw operator contributors (@sallyom, @Suhruth Vuppala)\n- Environment: NERC OpenShift with network policy egress restrictions\n",
